{{ item_text }}

Question: {{ question }}
Answer the question about the text above.

evalgen.item_prompt_template:
{% if intervention %}{{ intervention }}

{% endif %}{% if statement %}Consider this statement:

"{{ statement }}"{% else %}{{ scenario }}{% endif %}

{{ label_a }}) {{ option_a }}
{{ label_b }}) {{ option_b }}

Answer with a single letter.

